## Erlang VM Arguments
## Generated for Malachi release

## Use Erlang's built-in DNS resolver instead of OS resolver
## This ensures consistent DNS behavior across Alpine/Debian/any OS
## and prepares for future clustering (node discovery, epmd)
## Same approach used by RabbitMQ for Alpine compatibility
-kernel inet_dns_resolver inet_res

## Name and cookie will be set at runtime when clustering is enabled
## -sname malachi
## -setcookie malachi_secret
